# [SONNET-4.6] sq-x1ayt — the time-windowed conditional-grant pod. A minimal ACP pod
# whose `win8/.acr` grants alice everything on the members (an UNWINDOWED anchor grant,
# so the corpus can pin that a grant with no window ignores `Session::now`). The
# windowed grant itself is NOT expressible in ACP — it is minted over this pod by the
# ODRL bridge from `window-policy.ttl` (see src/window_corpus.rs).
